            </note>
            <note corresp="#d499-f2" n="64" xml:id="d499-f2-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d499-f3" n="65" xml:id="d499-f3-content">
                <p>Notation by the Adviser on Political Relations (Hornbeck): “I vote ‘no,’ S. K.
                    H.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
